---
import ContentShell from '../layouts/ContentShell.astro'
import { url } from '../data/slugs'

const UPDATED = '19 August 2026'
const CONTACT = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL ?? 'hello@punehire.com'

const description =
  'What Punehire does and does not stand behind: listings are informational and drawn from ' +
  'employer feeds as is, nothing here is a job offer, and nothing here is professional advice.'
---

<ContentShell
  title="Disclaimer | Punehire"
  description={description}
  path="/disclaimer/"
  h1="Disclaimer"
  lede="Punehire is an index that points at jobs published by other companies. This page states plainly what that does, and does not, make it responsible for."
  crumbs={[{ name: 'Disclaimer', href: '/disclaimer/' }]}
  narrow
>
  <p class="small muted">Last updated {UPDATED}.</p>

  <h2>Informational only</h2>
  <p>
    Everything on this site is provided for general information. A listing is a pointer to a
    role an employer published in its own hiring system, reproduced here to help you find it —
    not a recommendation, an endorsement, or a statement that the role is right for you. Decide
    for yourself whether to apply, and verify anything that matters on the employer's own page
    before you act on it.
  </p>

  <h2>No job offer, no employment relationship</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing here is an offer of employment and nothing here creates any relationship between you
    and Punehire or between you and an employer. Punehire is not the hiring company, is not a
    recruiter or agent for it, and plays no part in whether an application succeeds. An
    application is submitted on the employer's own system and is decided entirely by them.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy and currency</h2>
  <p>
    Feeds are re-read every six hours and the site is rebuilt from the result, so a role can
    close in the gap between two crawls. Some fields — experience ranges, role tags, remote
    classification, the area a company is filed under — are derived by pattern matching or kept
    by hand and are wrong sometimes. The listings are provided as is and without warranty of
    accuracy, completeness or availability. How each field is produced, and its limits, is set
    out in <a href={url.about()}>how this works</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Not professional advice</h2>
  <p>
    The guides and explanatory pages on this site are one maintainer's read of the Pune startup
    job market, not professional career, financial or legal advice. They carry no salary data
    and no ranking of employers, because the underlying feeds contain neither and inventing
    either would be worse than the gap. Treat them as background, not as a decision made for you.
  </p>

  <h2>External sites</h2>
  <p>
    Apply links and company links lead to third-party sites — the employer's applicant tracking
    system or its own pages. Punehire does not control those sites, is not responsible for their
    content, accuracy or privacy practices, and linking to one is not an endorsement of it. Once
    you leave this site, that site's terms and privacy policy apply, not this one.
  </p>

  <h2>Company names and trademarks</h2>
  <p>
    Company names, logos and job titles belong to their respective owners and are used here only
    to identify who is hiring and for what. Their appearance does not imply any affiliation with,
    or endorsement by, those companies.
  </p>

  <h2>Get something corrected</h2>
  <p>
    If a listing is stale, wrong, or should not be here, that is worth fixing. Write to
    <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT}`}>{CONTACT}</a> or see
    <a href="/contact/">contact and corrections</a>. Related:
    <a href="/terms/">terms of use</a>, <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.
  </p>
</ContentShell>

<style>
  h2 { margin-top: 1.9em; }
</style>
